{"hw":"ὑπολογίζομαι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ὑπολογίζομαι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὑπολογ-ίζομαι</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">take into account, take account of,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὑ. εἰς τὴν μίσθωσιν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">put</b> the payment <b class=\"lex-tr\">to the account</b> of.., ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2492.26</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> in pass. sense, <span class=\"gk\">-ισθεισὼν τῶν γεγενημένων προσόδων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">364.92</span> </span> (Ephesus, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B. C.</span>); <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὑπολογ-ισθήσεται</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἡ τιμὴ εἰς τὰς γινομένας ἀναφοράς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PRev.Laws</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">34.9</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">τὴν τιμὴν ἐκ τῶν ὀψωνίων ὑ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">deduct</b> the price from.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.39.15</span> </span>: so in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Act.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ptol.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Geog.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.14.6</span> </span>, and <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.13.3</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> metaph., <b class=\"lex-tr\">take into account,</b> <span class=\"gk\">κίνδυνον ὑ. τοῦ ζῆν ἢ τεθνάναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">28b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοὺς παρεληλυθότας πόνους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">231b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ἀλγεινόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">480c</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.99</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">197</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐδὲν ὑπελογίζοντο τὰς νίκας</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ Κίμωνος</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.33</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Din.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.5</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μηδὲν ὑ. τὸ ξενικὸν [τῶν νόμων], ἂν βελτίους φαίνωνται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">702c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑ... εἰ ἀποθνῄσκειν δεῖ πρὸ τοῦ ἀδικεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cri.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">48d</span> </span>.</div></div>"}